1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,000
Danspaus! Danspaus!

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Hoppa, hoppa!

3
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:05,000
Vicka, vicka!

4
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,300
Flyga runt!

5
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:09,200
Alla dansar – grön dans!

6
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,700
Grodan – grön!

7
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:14,600
Lampan – grön!

8
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:17,100
Jacka, ärtor, traktor – grönt!

9
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:18,900
Grönt, grönt, grönt …

10
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:19,700
Grönt betyder kör,

11
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:23,600
grön som en liten ärta!

12
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:26,600
Hej då, hej då – putt, putt!

